<description>&lt;p&gt;US authorities have taken a fugitive businessman into custody in Venezuela on bribery charges while President Maduro appears in court and a judge denied medical bail for Cilia Flores, prompting solidarity rallies. An aid worker reports severe earthquake damage in Venezuela and Starlink internet is now permitted to operate in the country, adding a new communications capability. Cuba’s grid collapse is worsening regional energy strain, and energy firms are recruiting former US officials to access Venezuelan oil amid allegations that a PDVSA plane was used to transport goods. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2007.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOX0dPTzMxQmZlR2ROS0E2T3czWFg4ZVNHb1A3NG9fdmFsQzdhSG5YOTBMVHgxZzEyeTJpaWZYMHNuaW52WlZmNHItb1hmR2xha1ZtemVjSkw4U2psUzdNRVFGTmFUQXVJRmJudGVPMzFSRnFtSUhrQ1F3b3lvTERwVjI1VkkzUXZnaUo5U2Z3ZWRxNnl4S1ppRFJ6RlJ3WkZUNFpjZkM2OUw0NnV4MG5yUVQ1Zms0N25od1NySEZIUERMMjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Palm Beach Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPX2FtUnZHdDhiclZveHdsRzZNYlRkYS1nTkhsbjhfWE5HVExVU3hwdmlPeW1QNlQxMkVqRUtFeDFYLXJPcHRwWVpHSW9hcllYX09FRjRUZlhYYU5sWjZodEM2RmRBdS1BRkxxWjZfcEdqSEJDV0VVeGpDY2VnTTVfOUZLYnpQNXRscHhqbGtONzI4ZHRUQlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxObjNOQ1RyWW84M1BQRlpBNjE0UnlicDJicjFzSGg1eGk5WUIyT0VXMkthaGtpVGxLcGZ5cm9HMS1hV1AtWWZ2UlAwcEw4SzZzVFJvOUxSODI2a01OYUFnbk5MY1FzUU9MSmktU3pGNUJvaVRESk0tM2NWYk9XOUZrRktGcXF6UVJiU2lkV0dqSlZMWWZvenBmRUpKd